%N A399365 Number of rooted unlabeled cacti with blocks of sizes 5 and 6, having n blocks.
%H A399365 Frédéric G. Speyser, <a href="/A399365/b399365.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..100</a>
%H A399365 Frédéric G. Speyser, <a href="https://github.com/frederic-speyser/cactus-mixed-cycle-lengths">mgonal_cactus_series_omega_blocks.py</a>
%H A399365 Frédéric G. Speyser, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22117807">Enumeration and Asymptotic Analysis of Strict Non-Plane Cactus Graphs over a Finite Set of Cycle Lengths</a> (working paper).
%F A399365 G.f. s(x) satisfies s(x) = exp(Sum_{i>=1} K(x^i)/i), where K(x) = K_5(x) + K_6(x), K_5(x) = (x/2)*(s(x)^4 + s(x^2)^2), K_6(x) = (x/2)*(s(x)^5 + s(x)*s(x^2)^2). Here x marks number of blocks, not vertices.
%o A399365 (Python) # See Links
%Y A399365 Cf. A398033 (case of a single size 5), A398034 (case of a single size 6), A399366 (unrooted).
